return {
    ["        这个世界实在是太无聊了！连像样的小说也没有，更别提网文、游戏和电影了，只能靠我自己来写了。\n        穿越到这个世界已经很久了，自从成为“通识者”途径的非凡者后，我靠着魔药的力量完整地回想起以前学过的所有知识，赞美义务教育与我的二本学历！然后我大抄特抄……哦，是将先进的文化与知识传播到这个世界。\n        凭借着才华与魅力，贵族们拉拢我，教会也喜欢我，没落的古斯塔夫家族又一次站在这个王国的顶端，我那便宜老爹老妈真应该谢谢我。但也有些想念我真正的家，成为这个途径的非凡者也是为了找到回家的方法。黄涛啊黄"] = "This world is just too boring! There are no decent novels, let alone web novels, games, or movies; I have to write them myself. \n It has been a long time since I crossed into this world. Ever since I became a Beyonder of the \"Savant\" pathway, I have relied on the power of the potion to fully recall all the knowledge I learned before. Praise compulsory education and my undergraduate degree! Then I copied and copied… oh, I mean, I spread advanced culture and knowledge to this world. \n Relying on talent and charm, the nobles court me, the Church likes me, and the fallen Gustav Family stands at the top of this kingdom once again. My cheap old man and old lady should really thank me. But I also miss my real home. Becoming a Beyonder of this pathway is also to find a way home. Huang Tao, ah Huang",
