    ["<Assistant_Title1>【隔墙有暖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>有一家人的屋内好像不太暖和……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>屋内的声音</>交互接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Stories</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It doesn't seem very warm inside one of the houses...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>voice from inside the house</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medals, Invoices",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精锻黄铜・蔷薇缠缚\n极为精美的仿真蔷薇，据说是第四纪遗留的古董饰品，担当着不对称审美的一环。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Precision Forged Brass/Rose Entanglement\nAn extremely exquisite artificial rose, said to be an antique ornament left over from the Fourth Epoch, serving as a piece of asymmetrical aesthetics.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不好，难道真是查尼斯门？）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Oh no, could it really be the Chanis Gate?) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（拿出怀表看了眼）</> 怎么都这个时间了，得赶紧去告解了，快走吧。"] = "<P_Heart> (Takes out a pocket watch and glances at it) </> Why is it this late already? Must hurry to confession, let's go.",
