    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>光线追踪</>\n光线追踪是一种通过模拟光线在三维场景中的传播路径来生成逼真图像的渲染技术。开启光线追踪后，会让游戏内的光照效果更加真实。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>设备支持</>\n光线追踪需要特定的显卡支持，目前仅限<Highlight>NVIDIA RTX 20/30/40系列</>支持，建议玩家在开启光追前检查显卡驱动或更新显卡驱动。光线追踪对设备的性能要求较高，玩家需根据需求选择是否开启该功能。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Ray Tracing </>\n Ray tracing is a rendering technique that generates realistic images by simulating the path of light in a 3D scene. Enabling ray tracing will make the lighting effects in the game more realistic. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Device Support </>\n Ray tracing requires specific graphics card support, currently limited to <Highlight> NVIDIA RTX 20/30/40 series </>. It is recommended that players check or update their graphics card drivers before enabling ray tracing. Ray tracing has high performance requirements for devices; players should choose whether to enable this feature based on their needs.",
